{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d6ebf8cb-9ddd-894d-95c8-9b4873266414",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T11:42:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmen Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I got a parking ticket and I want to ask about it. I'm gonna ask you something first, though, because I'm on a platform here and there's an announcement going, so if I say what, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Take your time. Can you tell me the ticket number, or the plate number it was issued to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got the ticket right here. Hang on. It's, uh, it says number 4471, and then a dash, 28. That's the whole thing on the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And the name on the registration?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmen Rivera. R-I-V-E-R-A. And the callback number if we get cut off is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Rivera. Let me pull that up. What was the violation, as it's written on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Overnight parking. It was the night of the storm, Friday into Saturday, the coastal one. I was parked in front of my own house, on the street, because the driveway's not, well, it's not something I can use. And I get a ticket at like five in the morning. In front of my own house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. I do have it here. It was issued Saturday morning, and it's showing as unpaid at this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, unpaid, because I wanna ask before I pay it. This is my first one. I've lived there a long time and never had one. Is there any way the fine can be waived, a first-time thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a process to request a review of a citation. I can't waive it from this desk. A request would be made in writing, and it would be reviewed. I would suggest you not ignore the ticket while it's pending, because the due date still applies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, in writing. Do I mail that, or is there a form, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have the citation review form mailed to you, or you can pick one up at the counter here at City Hall. If you give me a mailing address, I can send it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, I'm not giving the address on this call, I'll just come by and get one. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's perfectly fine. The counter is open during regular business hours, weekdays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the other thing is, I want a resident permit so this doesn't happen again. Like, I live on the street. I should be allowed to park on it, right? Do I need that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Overnight parking on city streets is restricted in winter, and a resident permit is handled through a separate application. You would need to show proof of residency and your vehicle registration. I'd recommend you bring both with you when you come for the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What counts as proof? Like a utility bill? Or, wait, is it the, um, the lease? I own, so I don't have a lease."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A recent utility bill in your name at that address is generally accepted. Bring your registration as well, and a photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, utility bill, registration, ID. Got it. Hold on, [pause] sorry, they just said my train's boarding in about ten minutes, so I'm good. Does the permit cost anything, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The staff at the counter can give you the current details when you apply. I don't want to quote you something that's out of date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. So just to make sure, I do not pay the ticket yet, I ask for the review form, and I apply for the permit separately. Same visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. Do keep an eye on the due date printed on the ticket. If the review is still pending, ask the counter about it when you're there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Okay, thank you, Ms. Whitcomb. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rivera. Have a safe trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
